    "Exchange/Visiting Pre-Arrival Guide - a. New Student Orientation\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nNew Student Orientation\nNew Exchange Student Orientation\nSeoul Campus\nCyber Building 1st Floor Auditorium\n2026.08.28 (Friday)\n14:00\nCyber Building 1st Floor Auditorium\n(\n사이버관 대강당\n)\nGlobal Campus\nCentennial Complex\nTBD\nCentennial Complex #209 (\n백년관 209호\n)\nThe\nNew Student Orientation\nis for all incoming non-degree international students (exchange, visiting) and will include applying for an RC and receiving important information related to living and studying in Korea at HUFS.\nThe information is generally the exact same as what is in this guidebook, as well as the presentation shared below.\nOrientation Material(seoul)\nDate & Time :\n202\n6.03.01\n14:00\nVenue :\nCyber Building 1st Floor Auditorium\nYou may refer to the previous semester's orientation presentation. Please note that the information may be updated or revised for the upcoming semester.\n2026-Spring-교환 OT_최종.pptx\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  ],
